{"seq":2,"slug":"merge-unmerge-safe","title":"合单后取消/退货拆单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-consolidation-group-ship/merge-conflict/merge-unmerge-safe","wordCount":2322,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"合单后取消-退货拆单\">合单后取消/退货拆单</h1><p>合单是一个跨时间的承诺，而承诺的成员随时可能变。买家在货还没发的时候取消了一件，或者在货已经发出去之后申请退其中一件——这两种情况看起来只差一个时点，实现在系统里却是两套完全不同的机制：<strong>未发运的拆单是撤销一次合并，已发运的拆单只能退化成「同包内部分退货」。</strong> 这一篇要把这两条路径都写清楚，重点放在「怎么拆得安全」——幂等、可回溯、账务可还原。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>拆单（unmerge）的前提是系统里存在一个明确的<strong>合并关系记录</strong>。合单不是把三笔订单改成一笔订单，而是建立一个持有关系：母包 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 持有子包集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(M)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，每个子包携带归属订单、归属卖家、申报价值、责任主体（这一结构见 <a href=\"../consolidation-tracking/master-child-package\">母包子包裹映射追踪</a>）。拆单就是在<strong>不改变子包本身</strong>的前提下，改变这个持有关系。</p>\n<p>因此拆单有三种操作，粒度与后果完全不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>何时可用</th>\n<th>账务后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>移除成员（detach）</td>\n<td>把子包从母包中取出，母包继续</td>\n<td>未发运、未合包或已合包未出库</td>\n<td>按剩余集合重算分摊，还原该子包费用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>整包撤销（dissolve）</td>\n<td>解散母包，所有子包回退独立</td>\n<td>未出库</td>\n<td>全部费用还原为独立计费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包内部分退货（partial return）</td>\n<td>母包不变，内部某子包进入退货流程</td>\n<td>已出库、已发运</td>\n<td>母包运费不可还原；退货成本单独计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[合单后收到取消/退货请求] --&gt; B{母包是否已出库}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| C[未发运路径]&#10;    B --&gt;|是| D[已发运路径]&#10;    C --&gt; E{取出一件后剩余成员数}&#10;    E --&gt;|0| F[整包撤销 dissolve]&#10;    E --&gt;|1| G[解散并从合单退化为独立发货]&#10;    E --&gt;|&gt;=2| H[移除成员 detach 母包重算]&#10;    H --&gt; I[重算计费重与分摊 生成调整分录]&#10;    F --&gt; I&#10;    D --&gt; J[包内部分退货]&#10;    J --&gt; K[生成退货子任务 母包轨迹不变]&#10;    K --&gt; L[退货入库后回到退货网络]\">graph TD\n    A[合单后收到取消/退货请求] --&gt; B{母包是否已出库}\n    B --&gt;|否| C[未发运路径]\n    B --&gt;|是| D[已发运路径]\n    C --&gt; E{取出一件后剩余成员数}\n    E --&gt;|0| F[整包撤销 dissolve]\n    E --&gt;|1| G[解散并从合单退化为独立发货]\n    E --&gt;|&gt;=2| H[移除成员 detach 母包重算]\n    H --&gt; I[重算计费重与分摊 生成调整分录]\n    F --&gt; I\n    D --&gt; J[包内部分退货]\n    J --&gt; K[生成退货子任务 母包轨迹不变]\n    K --&gt; L[退货入库后回到退货网络]</pre><h2 id=\"未发运拆单-重算而非减法\">未发运拆单：重算而非减法</h2><p>未发运拆单最大的诱惑是把它实现成减法：从母包成本里减去被移除子包分摊到的那一份。<strong>这是错的</strong>，而且错误会随拆单次数累积。</p>\n<p>原因在于合单的节省不是可加的。回到第二章第 1 篇的公式：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = (n-1)F + [\\sum_i f(w_i) - f(W)] - C_{merge}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。移除一件之后，新的计费重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>W</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W - w_{removed}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（因为体积重与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span></span> 都不可减），新的首重复用次数也不是原来的减一，通道档位甚至可能变回更便宜的档。同理分摊中若用了 Shapley，Shapley 值本身不是可加的。</p>\n<p>因此正确的做法是<strong>在剩余集合上重算</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>取出被移除的子包，得到剩余集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>S</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>∖</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S&#x27; = S \\setminus \\{i\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∖</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>S</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 重算计费重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>W</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（按 <a href=\"../merge-savings/weight-volume-combine\">合包重量/体积重合并计费</a> 的装箱估算与实测口径）。</li>\n<li>用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>S</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 重算成本与节省 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，与原始记录按<strong>同一个分摊算法版本</strong>重算各成员分摊。</li>\n<li>生成<strong>调整分录</strong>：原始分摊与重算分摊的差额，逐成员记一条调整，而不是只退还被移除者的那一份。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>第 4 步是关键：调整分录要把差额记到<strong>所有剩余成员</strong>头上，因为移除一件会让所有剩余成员的计费重与分摊都变化。只退还被移除者会导致剩余成员的账与实际不符，且这个不符在第二次、第三次拆单时继续累积。</p>\n<p>同时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{merge}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（合包作业费）的大部分已经<strong>实际发生</strong>（拣货、装箱、称重可能已经做了），不能因为一件被移除就全额退还。合理的口径是：作业已完成的成本不退还，仅按未完成部分退还。这就是为什么收费项要细分到能区分「已完成作业」与「未开始作业」（见 <a href=\"../merge-savings/consolidation-fee\">集运服务费与分摊</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"幂等与并发-拆单最难的部分\">幂等与并发：拆单最难的部分</h2><p>拆单请求来自多个入口（买家取消、客服工单、系统自动踢出、卖家缺货），它们会在时间上重叠。三个必须处理的并发场景：</p>\n<p><strong>重复请求。</strong> 同一件货的取消请求可能重试。拆单操作必须幂等：以「子包 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 是否仍在母包 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 中」作为前置条件，重复执行第二次时发现前置条件已不成立则直接返回成功且不产生第二次调整分录。这要求拆单有<strong>唯一键</strong>（例如 <code>(母包ID, 子包ID, 操作类型, 请求ID)</code>）与显式的前置条件检查，而不是依赖「读—改—写」的时序。</p>\n<p><strong>并发拆单不同成员。</strong> 同一母包的两件几乎同时被取消。若两个请求各读一次母包状态再各自写回，后写的会覆盖先写的。必须用<strong>乐观锁（版本号）或串行化队列</strong>。以母包为聚合根（aggregate root）加版本号是最干净的方案：所有改变持有关系的操作都通过母包这一聚合根进行，冲突时后到者重试并基于最新状态重算。这与聚合根模式的原则一致——一个聚合一个事务，跨聚合用 ID 引用。</p>\n<p><strong>拆单与出库竞争。</strong> 出库操作正在装箱扫描，同时收到拆单请求。此时<strong>出库是更强的操作</strong>：一旦母包进入「已出库」状态，拆单路径必须立刻从「未发运」切换到「已发运」，转换点必须是一个<strong>状态机上的原子跃迁</strong>（如 <code>PACKED → SHIPPED</code> 的时间戳），所有到达的拆单请求都以该时间戳为分界线路由。把分界线实现成「当前状态」而不是「请求到达时间」，是避免竞态的唯一稳妥做法，因为请求到达时间与状态变更时间之间总有窗口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"已发运拆单-退化成包内部分退货\">已发运拆单：退化成包内部分退货</h2><p>母包一旦离仓，物理上的拆开就不可能了，此时「取消一件」只能变成「整包照常送达，其中一件收货后退回」。这不是一种妥协下的坏方案，而是唯一正确的语义——因为物理事实不可逆，系统必须描述事实而不是掩盖它。</p>\n<p>这条路径上有三件事必须做对。</p>\n<p><strong>第一，买家的可见性不能断。</strong> 买家取消了其中一件，但母包仍会到货，且到货时包含那件被取消的货。系统必须明确告知买家「该件仍需签收，签收后按退货流程处理」，或者提供「拒收该件」的选项（若承运商支持部分拒收）。若什么都不做，买家会在收到一个包含已取消商品的包裹时产生客服工单，且平台无法解释。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，母包运费不可还原。</strong> 跨境运输已经发生，母包的运费、清关费用已经支出。包内部分退货<strong>不退还母包运费</strong>，只退还该件的商品价值（按退货政策）。这一条必须在买家的取消界面上<strong>提前告知</strong>，否则会产生「我取消了为什么还收运费」的争议。这也是集运模式与境内合单在体验上最大的差异。</p>\n<p><strong>第三，退货件回到退货网络而非本 hub。</strong> 被退回的子包进入的是逆向履约网络（本地退件点选址、质检、二次销售），本 hub 只负责生成一条指向它的退货子任务并保持母子包映射的更新。这一交接点应当明确：本 hub 输出「哪一件要退、它属于哪个母包、它的申报信息与价值」，退货网络输出「它到哪了、质检结论是什么」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时点</th>\n<th>拆单形态</th>\n<th>运费处理</th>\n<th>买家沟通要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>合单前</td>\n<td>无（不适用）</td>\n<td>独立计费</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合单后未合包</td>\n<td>detach / dissolve，重算</td>\n<td>按剩余集合重算并调整</td>\n<td>其余货不受影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已合包未出库</td>\n<td>detach / dissolve，重算</td>\n<td>已知作业费不退，未作业部分退</td>\n<td>出库时间可能顺延</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已出库未跨境</td>\n<td>包内部分退货（预登记）</td>\n<td>母包运费不退</td>\n<td>需签收或申请部分拒收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已跨境在途/已送达</td>\n<td>包内部分退货</td>\n<td>母包运费不退，退货成本另计</td>\n<td>走退货流程</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>合单建立的是持有关系而非订单合并；拆单改变的是持有关系，子包本身不变。</li>\n<li>三种拆单操作粒度不同：detach（移除成员）、dissolve（整包撤销）、partial return（包内部分退货），可用性由母包是否已出库决定。</li>\n<li>未发运拆单必须<strong>在剩余集合上重算</strong>而非做减法：计费重、节省、分摊都不可加；调整分录要记到所有剩余成员头上，否则偏差会随拆单次数累积。</li>\n<li>已实际发生的合包作业费不因拆单退还，只有未开始的作业可退——这要求服务费收费项细分到作业活动。</li>\n<li>幂等靠显式前置条件与唯一键；并发靠聚合根 + 版本号；竞态靠状态机原子跃迁（以状态变更时间戳而非请求到达时间划分路径）。</li>\n<li>已发运拆单只能退化为包内部分退货：母包运费不可还原且必须提前告知买家，退货件交由逆向网络处理。</li>\n<li>母子包映射的结构见 <a href=\"../consolidation-tracking/master-child-package\">母包子包裹映射追踪</a>；计费重重算见 <a href=\"../merge-savings/weight-volume-combine\">合包重量/体积重合并计费</a>；分摊与还原口径见 <a href=\"../merge-savings/consolidation-fee\">集运服务费与分摊</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"合单后取消/退货拆单","id":"合单后取消-退货拆单"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"未发运拆单：重算而非减法","id":"未发运拆单-重算而非减法"},{"level":2,"text":"幂等与并发：拆单最难的部分","id":"幂等与并发-拆单最难的部分"},{"level":2,"text":"已发运拆单：退化成包内部分退货","id":"已发运拆单-退化成包内部分退货"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"截单时间/备货不同步冲突","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-consolidation-group-ship/merge-conflict/time-window-conflict"},"next":{"title":"部分到货先发 vs 等齐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-consolidation-group-ship/merge-conflict/partial-ship-decision"}}